 "official_summary": " <p><b>Combating Pandemic Scams Act of 2020</b><br /><br /> This bill requires the Federal Trade Commission (FTC), in consultation with relevant agencies, to inform the public about mail, telemarketing, and internet scams related to COVID-19 (i.e., coronavirus disease 2019). The FTC must establish a national database for such information and must also disseminate information on&nbsp;how to report COVID-19-related scams to the appropriate agency. </p>",
